---
import Icon from '../Icon.astro';
import SectionHeader from '../SectionHeader.astro';
import { IMAGES } from '../../data/home';
---

<section id="chairman" class="section">
  <div class="container-x">
    <div class="grid overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border border-cream-100 bg-cream-50 lg:grid-cols-[1.4fr_1fr] lg:rounded-[2.5rem]">
      <div class="order-2 p-6 sm:p-10 lg:order-1 lg:p-12">
        <SectionHeader eyebrow="A letter from our founder" eyebrowClass="bg-white" title="Chairman's message" />

        <blockquote class="mt-6 flex gap-4">
          <span aria-hidden="true" class="-mt-2 text-6xl font-black leading-none text-amber-400">&ldquo;</span>
          <p class="text-lg font-medium leading-snug text-balance sm:text-xl lg:text-2xl">
            We aspire to achieve extraordinary results through carefully curated procedures tailored to each individual
            patient.
          </p>
        </blockquote>

        <p class="text-body mt-6 max-w-xl sm:text-base">
          At Chirag Global Hospitals, we are not enthused merely by numbers, conversions or targets. We do not measure
          our success only through profits, but through the benefits experienced by our patients and the blessings we
          receive from them.
        </p>

        <details class="group mt-5 max-w-xl">
          <summary class="inline-flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center gap-3 text-sm font-semibold text-brand-700">
            <span class="grid size-7 place-items-center rounded-full border border-amber-300 bg-white">
              <Icon name="plus" class="size-3.5 group-open:hidden" />
              <Icon name="minus" class="hidden size-3.5 group-open:block" />
            </span>
            <span class="group-open:hidden">Read the full message</span>
            <span class="hidden group-open:inline">Show less</span>
          </summary>
          <div class="text-body mt-4 space-y-3 sm:text-base">
            <p>
              Since 1986, our focus has stayed on one area of medicine, so that every patient who walks in is seen by a
              team that treats these conditions every day.
            </p>
            <p>
              We believe a patient should understand their diagnosis and options fully before any decision is made, and
              that every consultation deserves privacy and respect.
            </p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-5 border-t border-cream-100 pt-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
          <div>
            <p class="heading-4">Dr. Rajasekhar M. R.</p>
            <p class="text-meta mt-1">Founder and Chairman, Chirag Global Hospitals</p>
          </div>
          <a
            href="/about"
            class="btn btn-dark"
          >
            Know more about our chairman <Icon name="arrowRight" class="size-4" />
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="relative order-1 min-h-96 bg-cream-100 lg:order-2 lg:min-h-full">
        <img
          src={IMAGES.chairman}
          alt="Dr. Rajasekhar M. R., Founder and Chairman"
          loading="lazy"
          width="462"
          height="650"
          class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 mx-auto h-[94%] w-auto max-w-none object-contain object-bottom mix-blend-multiply"
          onerror="this.remove()"
        />
        <div class="absolute left-4 top-4 rounded-2xl bg-white px-4 py-2.5 shadow-md sm:left-auto sm:right-5 sm:top-5">
          <p class="text-xl font-black">1986</p>
          <p class="text-meta">Founded Chirag</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
